#: includes/class-admin.php:415
msgid "For Cloudflare R2: in the Cloudflare dashboard open R2, create a bucket, then “Manage R2 API tokens” → create a token with Object Read & Write for that bucket, and copy the access key id and secret here."
msgstr "对于 Cloudflare R2：请在 Cloudflare 控制面板中打开 R2，创建一个存储桶，然后前往“Manage R2 API tokens”→ 为该存储桶创建一个具有 Object Read & Write 权限的令牌，并在此处复制访问密钥 ID（access key id）和机密密钥。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:418
msgid "Dropbox app key"
msgstr "Dropbox 应用密钥"

#: includes/class-admin.php:419
msgid "Create an app at dropbox.com/developers/apps (Scoped access, App folder) with the files.content.read, files.content.write and files.metadata.read permissions, and copy its App key here. Save, then press Connect."
msgstr "在 dropbox.com/developers/apps (Scoped access, App folder) 创建一个具有 files.content.read、files.content.write 和 files.metadata.read 权限的应用程序，并将其 App key 复制到此处。保存，然后点击“连接”。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:421
